==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] such as [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]] or [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fried Shrimp Cat]] will be a massive help in taking out Dark Emperor Nyandam. [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating]] units will also work against the Shy Boys.

